{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"ADEVX-135 root caused with the debugging protocol and shipped as navapbc/agentic-development-platform#23 at afdf6d0, opened by hand with no rebar ticket under the corrected convention. record_usage_metrics upserts on (execution_id, stage) and its on_conflict_do_update assigns raw payload values, so it overwrites. The repair loop writes stage REPAIRING once per attempt against that one key, erasing every attempt but the last, and never passed cache_read_tokens."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789933522800340001,"uuid":"4247db7e-5ea1-4168-a0b7-15b9b63e4160"}